  (text "PitchIQ watch board rev E. Generated from scripts/design.py (edit there). Original pin map for our own Zephyr firmware." (at 40 560 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b0a3d3ee-2ecd-4e2d-b22a-c5bac3574bd0))
  (text "Bottom side (wrist side): USB-C J3, side switch SW1, battery pads BT1, jumper JP1, programming pads TP2-TP6 with R17-R20 and D4-D6, test pads TP1 and TP8. Everything else, including bring-up pads TP9-TP15, is on the top side." (at 40 565 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 318edd15-29b2-456b-8dff-3982afe58469))
  (text "NOT BUILT. Power chip pins were compared with Nordic's product specification v1.3 on paper (reviews/). The display connector position and type must be confirmed with a real panel before ordering." (at 40 570 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7915e6c4-e6f1-4a90-97aa-c3548257ccb2))
